d=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>A linked list is a data structure consisting of a sequence of nodes, whe=
re each node is linked to the next. A node in a linked list has two main co=
mponents: the data it stores (<code>val</code>) and a reference to the next=
 node (<code>next</code>) in the sequence:</p>
